        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A lock is a __reservation__ on a row taken by one transaction so another must wait. ==S== is taken by readers, ==X== by writers; the pair decides who queues.",
          "ink": "black"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Example : two `SELECT ... FOR SHARE` on row 7 both proceed; an `UPDATE` on row 7 blocks until both commit.",
